        </div>
          
        <div class="pageTitCol">
      <div class="pageTitInner">
        <h2 class="pageTit">Store Tournament 2026 Vol. 3</h2>
        <div class="pageTitInfoCol">
                                    <span class="pageTitCategory events"><a href="/events/#SHOPEVENTS">SHOP EVENTS</a></span>
                              </div>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="contentsCol">
      <div class="contentsColInner">

        
                <div class="blocks"><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="rd76v7m9l6o"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><div><strong><span style="font-size:240.00%;"><span style="color:#928157;">Official Store Tournaments Continue!</span></span></strong></div> <h3>Details</h3></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Period</h4></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>July 1 – September 30, 2026</p></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Overview</h4></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>The Official Store Tournaments continue!<br> Stores are given the flexibility to schedule the dates and choose a format that suits their community as well as receiving the support of the tournament kits.<br> The kit contents change every 3 months!<br><br> *In order to receive kits, stores must register through TCG+.<br> *Players who want to participate can start by searching for a local store on TCG+. Please scroll down for further details!</p></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Format</h4></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>Best-of-one games with 35 minute matches and 5 minutes of extra time</p></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-brand="" data-onepiece-category="NEWS,EVENTS,OTHERS" data-type="component-opcg-buttons"><div class="opcg-button-list"><div class="block text-center"><div class="button-panel"><a class="commonBtn" href="https://en.onepiece-cardgame.com/pdf/tournament_rules_manual.pdf?20260116" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Tournament Rules Manual<br class="spInline">(January 16, 2026)</span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Location</h4></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>Search for a local store on TCG+!</p></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-brand="" data-onepiece-category="NEWS,EVENTS,OTHERS" data-type="component-opcg-buttons"><div class="opcg-button-list"><div class="block text-center"><div class="button-panel"><a class="commonBtn" href="https://www.bandai-tcg-plus.com/storelist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Find a local store on TCG+!</span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p></p><h3>Prize List</h3></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Participation</h4> <h5>Tournament Pack 2026 Vol. 3 x1</h5></div></div><div class="sectionSideCol flexColum editor_row"><div class="sectionSideColImg" data-type="container-content"><div data-type="component-photo-onepiececg"><div class="photo-panel" style="text-align: center"><img class="img-middle" src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/1RvfYKJCayGRWKFn/batch_TK2026pillow_dummy.webp" alt="" img_id="en-35601"></div></div></div><div class="sectionSideColInner" data-type="container-content"><div class="editor_row"><div class="bgFrame" data-type="container-content"><div data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h5 class="sectionSideColTit txtCenter">Featured Card List</h5></div></div><div data-type="component-opcg-cards"><div class="imgCol imgCol-04"><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/CUbbRKHBkPyfywmg/batch_EB04-023.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/CUbbRKHBkPyfywmg/batch_EB04-023.webp" alt="カード画像">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/HPyN0HB4yQNQKKsw/batch_OP14-023.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/HPyN0HB4yQNQKKsw/batch_OP14-023.webp" alt="batch_OP14-023">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/FphcvK9ANrg8VlTm/batch_OP14-087.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/FphcvK9ANrg8VlTm/batch_OP14-087.webp" alt="batch_OP14-087">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/l44K1io7AhVq1CUi/batch_OP14-105.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/l44K1io7AhVq1CUi/batch_OP14-105.webp" alt="batch_OP14-105">             </a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>*1 card per pack<br> *4 types in total</p></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h4>Winner</h4> <h5>Winner Pack 2026 Vol. 3 x1</h5></div></div><div class="sectionSideCol flexColum editor_row"><div class="sectionSideColImg" data-type="container-content"><div data-type="component-photo-onepiececg"><div class="photo-panel" style="text-align: center"><img class="img-middle" src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/28qWsTQjWKYZUlmL/batch_TK2026pillow_win_dummy.webp" alt="" img_id="en-35603"></div></div></div><div class="sectionSideColInner" data-type="container-content"><div class="editor_row"><div class="bgFrame" data-type="container-content"><div data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h5 class="sectionSideColTit txtCenter">Featured Card List</h5></div></div><div data-type="component-opcg-cards"><div class="imgCol imgCol-04"><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/JJ7eH4ta1IbLexH9/batch_EB04-023_win.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/JJ7eH4ta1IbLexH9/batch_EB04-023_win.webp" alt="カード画像">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/z8N1WhY56fjgBOeq/batch_OP14-023_win.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/z8N1WhY56fjgBOeq/batch_OP14-023_win.webp" alt="batch_OP14-023_win">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/0QVexspcsi8XUbQL/batch_OP14-087_win.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/0QVexspcsi8XUbQL/batch_OP14-087_win.webp" alt="batch_OP14-087_win">             </a></div><div class="imgColWrap col"><a class="img img-card img-zoom js_modalOpenImage" data-fancybox="group_1" href="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/aVr5MIqfmnw4O0zw/batch_OP14-105_win.webp" aria-label="画像を拡大表示">                 <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/aVr5MIqfmnw4O0zw/batch_OP14-105_win.webp" alt="batch_OP14-105_win">             </a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>*1 card per pack<br> *4 types in total</p></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h3>Application Method</h3> <p>*Players are encouraged to apply for the tournament through TCG+ and stores are also encourage to accept the application from players through TCG+.<br><br> However stores manage event registrations in different ways - Please be sure to contact your local game store directly to confirm your registration and participation.<br><br> BANDAI will not be responsible for any problems that may occur between the store and the player.<br><br> For how to register on TCG+ please check the bottom of this page.<br><span style="color:#ca0000;">*A Bandai Namco ID is required to register on TCG+.</span></p> <h4>For July Store Tournaments</h4> <p>Store Registration: May 1-31, 2026<br> Player Registration: June 17, 2026 onwards</p> <h4>For August Store Tournaments</h4> <p>Store Registration: June 1-30, 2026<br> Player Registration: July 18, 2026 onwards</p> <h4>For September Store Tournaments</h4> <p>Store Registration: July 1-31, 2026<br> Player Registration: August 18, 2026 onwards</p></div></div></div></div><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="10a9gfvo374"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-brand="" data-onepiece-category="NEWS,EVENTS,OTHERS" data-type="component-opcg-buttons"><div class="opcg-button-list"><div class="block text-center"><div class="button-panel"><a class="commonBtn" href="https://www.bandai-tcg-plus.com/storelist" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Apply on TCG+!</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="33av55shf5"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p style="text-align: center;">Event search keyword:<br> [ENG] ONE PIECE Store Tournament Event</p></div></div></div></div><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="50c0og7ke7k"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><h3>What is Bandai TCG+?</h3></div></div><div class="sideCol sideCol-01 row"><div class="sideColWrap col" data-type="container-content"><div data-type="component-photo-onepiececg"><div class="photo-panel" style="text-align: center"><a href="https://lp.bandai-tcg-plus.com/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">             <img src="/onepiececg/bccard/en/news/2026/06/05/BQCRf8yxOh4CWQxS/bnr_tcg.webp" style="undefined">            </a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="ald4vjrbg3k"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>TCG+ is a one-stop application for Bandai Card Games that includes finding a store near to you, registering for events, tournament attendance and pairings, deck building features, and statistics.</p><h3>Tournament Rules</h3> <p>The tournament will be held in accordance with the Official Rules on the official website.<br> Please read the Official Rules and Q&amp;A carefully before participating.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="row js-setGallery rel-base c-gallery" baserel="j30u615cra4"><div class="col-sm-12 ui-resizable" data-type="container-content"><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-brand="" data-onepiece-category="NEWS,EVENTS,OTHERS" data-type="component-opcg-buttons"><div class="opcg-button-list"><div class="block text-center"><div class="button-panel"><a class="commonBtn" href="https://en.onepiece-cardgame.com/pdf/rule_manual.pdf?20230623" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Official Rules Manual (June 23, 2023)<br class="spInline">Tournament Rules Manual</span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-brand="" data-onepiece-category="NEWS,EVENTS,OTHERS" data-type="component-opcg-buttons"><div class="opcg-button-list"><div class="block text-center"><div class="button-panel"><a class="commonBtn" href="https://en.onepiece-cardgame.com/pdf/tournament_rules_manual.pdf?20260116" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Tournament Rules Manual<br class="spInline">(January 16, 2026)</span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-ip="onepiececg" data-site="" data-type="component-text"><div class="text-area"><p>*If you have any questions about the rules during a battle, or if you have any doubts about whether or not something is correct, please raise your hand immediately and ask for a decision from the "staff" and follow their ruling. Please note that correct judgments cannot be made after the battle has progressed.<br> *Cards that are not legitimate, such as photocopied cards, cannot be used.</p></div></div></div></div></div>        
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>

